        <briefdescription>
<para>Classify the request and continue the chain or send a rejection response. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Invoked by Drogon on its IO thread; verdicts map as: BLACKLISTED -&gt; 403, RATELIMITED -&gt; 429, BANNED -&gt; 503, ERROR -&gt; 500. ALLOWED/WHITELISTED and any unrecognised status invoke <computeroutput>fccb</computeroutput>; rejected requests invoke <computeroutput>fcb</computeroutput> only. <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">req</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Request supplying peer IP, method, path, headers and body for classification. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="inout">fcb</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Filter callback used to send the rejection response. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="inout">fccb</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Chain callback invoked when the request is permitted. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
